@startuml
title 生产、仓库流入与状态投影（2026-11 当前态）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty members

package "配置数据" {
  class WorldOptions {
    +Shapes : List
    +Liquids : List
    +Flow : FlowOptions
    +Producers : List
    +ProducerSlots : int
    +Workshops : List
    +Clone() : WorldOptions
    +Validate() : WorldValidationResult
  }

  class FlowOptions {
    +JarCount : int
    +LiquidAmount : int
    +LiquidRate : Dictionary
  }

  class ProducerOptions {
    +Name : string
    +Rates : Dictionary
  }

  class WorkshopOptions {
    +Name : string
    +BaseMarks : List
    +AdditionalMarks : List
    +Ban : List
  }
}

package "生产运行时" {
  class JarSystem {
    +FlowSettings : (int, int)
    +ProducerModule : ProducerModule
    +LiquidProduction : LiquidProduction
    +Tick(count) : int
  }

  class ProducerModule {
    +ProducerSlots : int
    +UsedSlots : int
    +Producers : IReadOnlyDictionary
    +Generators : IReadOnlyDictionary
    +Warehouse : Warehouse
    +RegisterProducer(name, rates)
    +UpdateRate(name, shape, rate)
    +Tick(count) : List
  }

  class Producer {
    +Name : string
    +Rates : IReadOnlyDictionary
  }

  class ShapeProductionLine {
    +Shape : string
    +Rate : double
    +Accumulated : double
    +Producers : IReadOnlyList
    +HasPositiveRate : bool
    +Tick() : List
  }

  class LiquidProduction {
    +Rates : IReadOnlyDictionary
    +Accumulated : IReadOnlyDictionary
    +SetRate(liquid, rate)
    +Tick() : List
    +WillProduceNextTick(liquid) : bool
  }

  class Warehouse {
    +Jars : IReadOnlyList
    +LiquidWarehouse : IReadOnlyDictionary
    +StoreJars(jars)
    +ProduceLiquid(liquid, amount)
    +FlowToMaster(master, jars, liquid)
  }
}

package "应用服务" {
  class ProductionService {
    +TickStep()
    +FlushFlow()
    +UpdateProducerRate(name, shape, rate)
    +UpdateLiquidProductionRate(liquid, rate)
  }
}

package "状态读模型" {
  class StateSerializer {
    {static} +Snapshot(system) : StateDto
  }

  class StateDto {
    +Warehouse : WarehouseStateDto
    +ProducerStatus : ProducerStatusDto
  }

  class ProducerStatusDto {
    +Producers : List
    +Generators : List
    +Slots : ProducerSlotStatusDto
    +Flow : ProductionFlowStatusDto
    +LiquidRates : Dictionary
    +LiquidAccumulated : Dictionary
    +Warehouse : ProducerWarehouseDto
  }

  class ProducerSlotStatusDto {
    +Used : int
    +Limit : int
  }

  class ProductionFlowStatusDto {
    +Jars : int
    +LiquidPerLiquid : int
  }

  class GeneratorStatusDto {
    +Shape : string
    +Rate : double
    +Accumulated : double
    +Producers : int
  }

  class WarehouseStateDto {
    +Jars : int
    +JarList : List
    +Liquids : Dictionary
  }
}

package "宿主表现" {
  class CommandDispatcher {
    +HandleAsync(service, socket, type, data)
  }

  class PlayPage {
    +render()
    +send(type, data)
  }

  class ProductionView {
    +render(producerStatus, warehouse, state)
  }
}

WorldOptions *-- FlowOptions
WorldOptions *-- "0..*" ProducerOptions
WorldOptions *-- "0..*" WorkshopOptions

JarSystem *-- ProducerModule
JarSystem *-- LiquidProduction
ProducerModule *-- Warehouse
ProducerModule o-- "0..*" Producer
ProducerModule *-- "1..*" ShapeProductionLine
ShapeProductionLine ..> Producer : 读取生产源速率

ProductionService --> ProducerModule : 产罐
ProductionService --> LiquidProduction : 产液
ProductionService --> Warehouse : 入库 / 流往主台
ProductionService --> JarSystem : 读取 FlowSettings 与修饰器

StateSerializer ..> JarSystem : 只读快照
StateSerializer --> StateDto : 构造投影
StateDto *-- ProducerStatusDto
StateDto *-- WarehouseStateDto
ProducerStatusDto *-- ProducerSlotStatusDto
ProducerStatusDto *-- ProductionFlowStatusDto
ProducerStatusDto *-- "1..*" GeneratorStatusDto

CommandDispatcher --> JarSystem : 命令
PlayPage --> ProductionView : 只读渲染
ProductionView ..> ProducerStatusDto : 消费 slots / flow / generators
ProductionView ..> WarehouseStateDto : 显示库存

note right of ProducerModule
  **真实实体关系**
  · Producer 是生产源；
  · ShapeProductionLine 是按形状聚合的执行线；
  · ProducerModule 负责速率规则与槽位；
  · Warehouse 只接收入库与搬运，不创造资源。
end note

note bottom of ProductionService
  **TickStep**：ProducerModule.Tick + LiquidProduction.Tick
  将新资源放入 Warehouse。

  **FlushFlow**：Warehouse.FlowToMaster
  只搬已有库存，不产生新资源。
end note

note right of ProducerStatusDto
  `producerStatus.slots` 与 `producerStatus.flow`
  是本轮新增的公开只读键。

  页面不得从库存差值反推“生产量”，
  也不得自行计算槽位上限。
end note
@enduml
